{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LEV","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"利未記","commonName":"利未記","title":"利未記","order":3,"numberOfChapters":27,"sha256":"27679654bd4a243e5f935565bf0199f4689dc466438245b0da235429f33fe2d8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LEV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":27,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LEV/27.json","totalNumberOfVerses":856},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["獻素祭的條例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「如果有人獻素祭給耶和華，要用細麵粉作祭物。要在細麵粉上澆油、加乳香，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["帶到做祭司的亞倫子孫那裡。祭司要抓一把澆了油的細麵粉，連同所有乳香放在壇上焚燒，作為象徵。這是蒙耶和華悅納的馨香火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["剩下的素祭要歸亞倫及其子孫，這在獻給耶和華的火祭中是至聖之物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["「如果獻用爐子烤的素祭，要獻調油的無酵細麵餅，或塗油的無酵薄餅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["「如果獻用平底鍋烤的素祭，要獻調油的無酵細麵餅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["要把餅掰成碎塊，澆上油。這是素祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["「如果獻用煎鍋煎的素祭，要獻用細麵粉和油做的祭物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["「要把這樣做好的素祭帶到耶和華面前，交給祭司獻在祭壇上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["祭司要從中取出一部分，作為象徵放在祭壇上焚燒。這是蒙耶和華悅納的馨香火祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["剩下的素祭要歸亞倫及其子孫。這在獻給耶和華的火祭中是至聖之物。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["「獻給耶和華的任何素祭都不可含酵，因為你們不可把酵或蜜當作火祭獻給耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你們可以把酵和蜜作為初熟之祭獻給耶和華，但不可作為馨香之祭獻在祭壇上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["所有素祭都要用鹽調味，不可少了你們與上帝立約的鹽。所有祭物中都要放鹽。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["「如果將初熟的穀物獻給耶和華作素祭，要用烘好後壓碎的新麥穗，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["加上油和乳香。這是素祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["祭司要將一些壓碎的麥穗、油及所有乳香作為象徵焚燒。這是獻給耶和華的火祭。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LEV/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LEV/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/LEV/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}